# --- Handoff bundles ---
# A member's bundle is unzipped outside the repo, applied, and committed by
# its owner. The bundle itself - instructions, patch, file copies, or the
# leftovers of a failed apply - never belongs in the repository.
handoff/
.handoff-internal.md
READ_ME_FIRST.md
/files/
*.patch
*.orig
*.rej
